templateVersions.content:
Your task is to generate a notification message for the doctor, to be sent 15 minutes before the scheduled appointment. The message should include the following:
The doctor's name (as provided below).
Key details about the patient, including the reason for the upcoming appointment.
A summary of the historical encounter data.
The duration of the upcoming appointment.
Patient Data: {!$Input:PatientData}
Appointment Details: {!$Input:CurrentClinicalEncounter}
Historical Appointment Details: {!$Input:HistoricalEncounterData}

Your task is to generate a notification message for the doctor, to be sent 15 minutes before the scheduled appointment. The message should include the following:
The doctor's name (as provided below).
Key details about the patient, including the reason for the upcoming appointment.
A summary of the historical encounter data.
The duration of the upcoming appointment.
Patient Data: {!$Input:PatientData}
Appointment Details: {!$Input:CurrentClinicalEncounter}
Historical Appointment Details: {!$Input:HistoricalEncounterData}

Instead of ending the message with "Best regards" or similar phrases, simply ask if there is anything else the doctor would like to know.

